{
  "chapter_id": "CH017",
  "title": "Nothing by Chance",
  "sections": [
    {
      "section_id": "SEC064",
      "title": "Practice, Not Accident",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Christianity is real, but it is not lived by chance. You do not drift into a life of faith; you practice your life deliberately, the way you would practice anything else you wanted to master.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA253",
            "SRC007225",
            "SRC007227",
            "SRC007234"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007225",
            "SRC007227",
            "SRC007234",
            "SRC007254",
            "SRC007255"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA253"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000001",
          "provider_handle": "p1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Spiritual truths are only proven true through practice and use, not by mere declaration. We must practice them. You will know only when you use what you have been given, because using it is what proves that it works.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA040",
            "SRC001216",
            "SRC001220",
            "SRC001223"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC001216",
            "SRC001220",
            "SRC001223"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA040"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000002",
          "provider_handle": "p2"
        },
        {
          "text": "I practice it. I set my mind on it. This is not something that happens automatically; it requires daily, conscious attention to live in faith rather than in habit.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA253",
            "SRC007254",
            "SRC007255"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007254",
            "SRC007255",
            "SRC007225",
            "SRC007227",
            "SRC007234"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA253"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000003",
          "provider_handle": "p3"
        },
        {
          "text": "I live life, and I have an aura around me that will not allow certain things, because I am practicing life. An intentional practice of life surrounds a person with a kind of protection that prevents certain accidents from happening.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA254",
            "SRC007244",
            "SRC007246",
            "SRC007248",
            "SRC007250"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007244",
            "SRC007246",
            "SRC007248",
            "SRC007250"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA254"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000004",
          "provider_handle": "p4"
        },
        {
          "text": "This intentionality extends even to speech. When I notice I have spoken wrong, I take it back. I cancel that one, and I say what I am supposed to say instead. Even when I am praying, if I say something that is not right, I correct it immediately: no, I cancel that one, this is what I want to say.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA255",
            "SRC007261",
            "SRC007264",
            "SRC007268",
            "SRC007271",
            "SRC007274",
            "SRC007276",
            "SRC007277",
            "SRC007278"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007261",
            "SRC007264",
            "SRC007268",
            "SRC007271",
            "SRC007274",
            "SRC007276",
            "SRC007277",
            "SRC007278"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA255"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000005",
          "provider_handle": "p5"
        },
        {
          "text": "This same discipline of trained confidence shows itself in how one faces ordinary danger.",
          "kind": "connective",
          "evidence_handles": [],
          "source_refs": [],
          "idea_refs": [],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000006",
          "provider_handle": "p6"
        },
        {
          "text": "God told me that death has not been permitted to take me, and I have trained myself to walk in that confidence. When I enter a plane, I sleep. Training oneself spiritually in this way reflects a deep trust that death has no permission to take hold.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA267",
            "SRC007621",
            "SRC007625",
            "SRC007626",
            "SRC007634",
            "SRC007636"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007621",
            "SRC007625",
            "SRC007626",
            "SRC007634",
            "SRC007636"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA267"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000007",
          "provider_handle": "p7"
        },
        {
          "text": "I was traveling with the Ethiopian airline once, and I was sleeping. The plane went through turbulence badly enough that one of the passengers stood up to pray out of fear. Afterward, some young people on the flight told me that when they saw me sleeping through it, they knew nothing bad would happen to that plane. They said, the man is sleeping, so don't worry yourself.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA267",
            "EX045",
            "SRC007567",
            "SRC007573",
            "SRC007589",
            "SRC007590",
            "SRC007606",
            "SRC007609",
            "SRC007614"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007567",
            "SRC007573",
            "SRC007589",
            "SRC007590",
            "SRC007606",
            "SRC007609",
            "SRC007614",
            "SRC007621",
            "SRC007625",
            "SRC007626",
            "SRC007634",
            "SRC007636"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA267"
          ],
          "example_refs": [
            "EX045"
          ],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000008",
          "provider_handle": "p8"
        },
        {
          "text": "Christianity is real, but we must not judge it by people who are not practicing it. That is why Paul could speak of his own fatigue and labor and still say, 'Be my imitators as I imitate Christ' — he offered his own life, faithfully practiced, as the standard by which the faith should be judged.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA268",
            "REF057",
            "SRC007654",
            "SRC007655",
            "SRC007657",
            "SRC007658",
            "SRC007659"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007654",
            "SRC007655",
            "SRC007657",
            "SRC007658",
            "SRC007659"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA268"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [
            "REF057"
          ],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000009",
          "provider_handle": "p9"
        }
      ],
      "idea_refs": [
        "IDEA040",
        "IDEA253",
        "IDEA254",
        "IDEA255",
        "IDEA267",
        "IDEA268"
      ],
