    {
      "section_id": "SEC065",
      "title": "God Did Not Make Anyone Poor",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "I heard a pastor recently who was saying that God made poor people, drawing this claim from the book of Proverbs — that God himself is the maker of poor people.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA256",
            "SRC007308",
            "SRC007310",
            "SRC007312",
            "SRC007314"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007308",
            "SRC007310",
            "SRC007312",
            "SRC007314"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA256"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000010",
          "provider_handle": "p10"
        },
        {
          "text": "God created everybody, but he did not make anybody poor. Whatever blessing God gives, he does not design poverty into anyone's life.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA257",
            "SRC007316",
            "SRC007318",
            "SRC007319",
            "SRC007320"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007316",
            "SRC007318",
            "SRC007319",
            "SRC007320"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA257"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000011",
          "provider_handle": "p11"
        },
        {
          "text": "There are things in life that come down to choice. If you make a wrong choice, you will harvest badly. Some hardships people face in life are not imposed by God but are the harvest of choices that were wrong from the start.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA258",
            "SRC007331",
            "SRC007337",
            "SRC007339"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007331",
            "SRC007337",
            "SRC007339"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA258"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000012",
          "provider_handle": "p12"
        },
        {
          "text": "To examine this more closely, look at how Proverbs itself speaks of the poor.",
          "kind": "connective",
          "evidence_handles": [],
          "source_refs": [],
          "idea_refs": [],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000013",
          "provider_handle": "p13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Proverbs chapter 19, verse 1 reads: 'Better is the poor man that walketh in his integrity.' A poor man who works with integrity is good — the emphasis of the text falls on integrity, not on poverty as something to be praised or sought for its own sake.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA259",
            "REF053",
            "SRC007328",
            "SRC007341",
            "SRC007342",
            "SRC007343",
            "SRC007349",
            "SRC007365",
            "SRC007367"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007328",
            "SRC007341",
            "SRC007342",
            "SRC007343",
            "SRC007349",
            "SRC007365",
            "SRC007367"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA259"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [
            "REF053"
          ],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000014",
          "provider_handle": "p14"
        },
        {
          "text": "The same chapter also warns that a soul without knowledge is not good, and that whoever hastens with his feet sins. Lack of knowledge and hasty action lead to sin or failure.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA260",
            "SRC007390",
            "SRC007392"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007390",
            "SRC007392"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA260"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000015",
          "provider_handle": "p15"
        },
        {
          "text": "It speaks too of a man who perverts his ways, his heart fretting against God — a picture of human folly. This can be framed in terms of a pattern inherited generationally, from ancestors, as opposed to a lineage found in God.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA261",
            "SRC007396",
            "SRC007540",
            "SRC007542",
            "SRC007546"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007396",
            "SRC007540",
            "SRC007542",
            "SRC007546"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA261"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000016",
          "provider_handle": "p16"
        },
        {
          "text": "Other verses in the same passage speak of what wealth and poverty do socially.",
          "kind": "connective",
          "evidence_handles": [],
          "source_refs": [],
          "idea_refs": [],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000017",
          "provider_handle": "p17"
        },
        {
          "text": "Look at verse four: wealth makes many friends, as honey draws flies, while poverty drives them away. Multiple Bible translations render this verse the same way — wealth attracts, poverty repels.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA262",
            "REF054",
            "SRC007398",
            "SRC007485",
            "SRC007486",
            "SRC007495",
            "SRC007496"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007398",
            "SRC007485",
            "SRC007486",
            "SRC007495",
            "SRC007496"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA262"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [
            "REF054"
          ],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000018",
          "provider_handle": "p18"
        },
        {
          "text": "God is the maker of us all, without exception. But the trajectory a person's life takes — toward poverty or toward wealth — is often shaped by choices, sometimes choices made before that person was even born, by their parents or ancestors. It may not be the individual's own direct choice, yet it still shapes the path.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA263",
            "SRC007500",
            "SRC007501",
            "SRC007503",
            "SRC007526"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007500",
            "SRC007501",
            "SRC007503",
            "SRC007526"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA263"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000019",
          "provider_handle": "p19"
        },
        {
          "text": "I know Mama Jan. Nobody knew her; she was dragging her children through extreme poverty and facing the jealousy of others. But she made a choice: she said she would change the trajectory, and vowed that no child under her would ever again sleep without eating.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA263",
            "EX044",
            "SRC007507",
            "SRC007513",
            "SRC007515",
            "SRC007518",
            "SRC007519",
            "SRC007521"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007507",
            "SRC007513",
            "SRC007515",
            "SRC007518",
            "SRC007519",
            "SRC007521",
            "SRC007500",
            "SRC007501",
            "SRC007503",
            "SRC007526"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA263"
          ],
          "example_refs": [
            "EX044"
          ],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000020",
          "provider_handle": "p20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Some parents simply do nothing. They don't work, and then they find reasons to justify their condition — blaming it on something vague, or saying it's my ancestors, rather than taking responsibility themselves.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA264",
            "SRC007527",
            "SRC007529",
            "SRC007532",
            "SRC007533"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007527",
            "SRC007529",
            "SRC007532",
            "SRC007533"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA264"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [
            "UNC033"
          ],
          "paragraph_id": "P000021",
          "provider_handle": "p21"
        },
        {
          "text": "So do not go and say God made me like that. God did not make you like that, my friend. You have made a choice, or a choice was made for you before you were born — but it was not God who made you poor. Do not blame God for the consequences of choices that were never his.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA265",
            "SRC007547",
            "SRC007549",
            "SRC007550"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007547",
            "SRC007549",
            "SRC007550"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA265"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000022",
          "provider_handle": "p22"
        }
      ],
